+Incoming plain-text mail to `SUBDOMAIN@HELPDESK_SUPPORT_DOMAIN` opens a ticket for that business; account recipients in `Cc` are recognized too. A known customer is reused, while a new sender gets an unverified customer account and verification email. Automated/list mail, ambiguous multi-business deliveries, and duplicate Message-IDs are ignored.
+
+Every ticket has a private support-domain reply address. Replies from the requester reopen pending or solved email tickets, while mail to the plain business address always opens a new ticket. Staff public replies to email-origin tickets are emailed to the requester with the private address as `Reply-To`; private notes and portal-origin tickets remain in-app only.
+
